rom attempting to shift local geographic features to get out of chores, particularly cleaning stables.<br /> <br /> 8) Folklore and myth may now fall under &amp;quot;imitable material&amp;quot; and should be handled accordingly.</div> </div> </div> </div>9)Martial arts movies, spy thrillers, and fantasy tales are included.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T12:46:40-07:00","id":1336624,"title":"","content":"10) If your child is suddenly able to jump several miles high, it is vital to forbid them from doing so until you make absolutely certain that they are actually able to fall down without injuring themselves. If they can land safely, you can proceed to teach them to watch for passing planes so as to not collide with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T12:50:37-07:00","id":1336627,"title":"","content":"11) Stranger danger includes communing with the Neverborn or the Yozi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord","name":"Uknown DarkLord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3012_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:18:08-07:00","id":1336659,"title":"","content":"12) In case your child has an affinity for Craft, be sure to clarify that superweapons are not acceptable gifts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11320-gigaton-falcon-emu","name":"Gigaton-Falcon-Emu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"786"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T19:15:43-07:00","id":1336987,"title":"","content":"13) Make sure your child has plenty of healthy outlets for their energy. Essence fever is no joke, and if your child cannot find any constructive uses for their newfound power they will almost certainly find <i>de</i>structive uses!<br /> <br /> 14) You should probably have a chat with your local deity or deities, and sooner rather than later (unless you're living somewhere where the Immaculate Order holds sway). Aside from the obvious fact that it's always a good idea to make sure you can get along with your neighbors, a god may very well be able to help with your child's education in ways that you aren't equipped to deal with -- and any sensible divinity should understand why it's smart to get on a young Exalt's good side while they can. You should be prepared to swallow your pride before asking any favors of a god (especially if you're mortal), but don't let your child grow up thinking that some small god is actually the boss of them!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-21T15:11:22-07:00","id":1337273,"title":"","content":"15) Despite their uncanny knack for augury, it's important to remain skeptical of your Sidereal child's predictions. For instance, if your child refuses to do their homework because &quot;the dog will eat it&quot;, they're probably lying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-21T15:40:53-07:00","id":1337275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epitome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1336030-101-things-to-watch-out-for-when-your-child-exalts-as-a-solar-dragonblooded-etc?p=1337273#post1337273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">15) Despite their uncanny knack for augury, it's important to remain skeptical of your Sidereal child's predictions. For instance, if your child refuses to do their homework because &amp;quot;the dog will eat it&amp;quot;, they're probably lying.</div> </div> </div> </div>16) unless they're friends with a lunar. Then yes, maybe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"a